{"sha": "30e8e5e0ed4541a50daf0c9c2d68fe93c1e206ac506c4add6826b604f8b13e34", "body": ["\\textbf{5.} $v^* = \\sqrt{2k_BT/m} = \\qty{580}{m/s}$; $\\nu v^*/c \\approx \\qty{0.9}{GHz}$;", "精确公式给出 \\qty{1.5}{GHz}。", "", "\\textbf{6.} $g_0 = \\qty{0.09}{m^{-1}}$；$\\eu^{0.027}$：$2.7\\%$ 每程。", "", "\\textbf{7.} $g_{\\text{th}} = -\\ln(0.999 \\times 0.99)/0.6 = \\qty{0.018}{m^{-1}}$;", "裕量 $5$。", "", "\\textbf{8.} \\qty{500}{MHz}；三个。", "", "\\textbf{9.} $P_{\\text{in}} = \\qty{1}{mW}/0.01 = \\qty{100}{mW}$; \\qty{1.3e5}{W/m^2}.", "", "\\textbf{10.} 增益饱和至 $g_{\\text{th}}$；多余的", "能量转为输出光子（以及自发辐射、热量）。", "", "\\textbf{11.} $\\qty{1}{mW}/\\qty{7.5}{W} = 1.3 \\times 10^{-4}$：大部分", "电子能量流向氦亚稳态之外，且", "光子携带了投入的 \\qty{20.66}{eV} 中的 \\qty{1.96}{eV}。", "", "\\textbf{12.} $2 \\times 0.072 \\times 0.3 = 0.043$; $N = 0.1 \\times 2 \\times 10^{-9}/3.14", "\\times 10^{-19} = 6.4 \\times 10^8$；$20.3/0.043 \\approx 470$ 次往返；", "\\qty{0.9}{\\micro s}.", "", "\\textbf{13.} $\\delta\\nu = \\nu\\,\\delta L/L = \\qty{1.6}{GHz}$：模式穿过", "整条增益曲线 --- 除非腔长保持稳定，激光器", "就会跳到另一个模式。", "", "\\textbf{14.} $p$ 偏振无", "反射地穿过布儒斯特表面；$s$ 偏振每个表面损失约 $15\\%$，", "从不达到阈值：输出线偏振光，且无额外代价。", "", "\\textbf{15.} $z_{\\text{R}} = \\qty{0.45}{m}$; $\\theta = \\qty{6.7e-4}{rad}$; $w(\\qty{10}{m})", "= \\qty{6.7}{mm}$：全宽 \\qty{13}{mm}。", "", "\\textbf{16.} $2P/\\pi w_0^2 = \\qty{7}{kW/m^2}$：相当于七个太阳。", "", "\\textbf{17.} $w_0' = \\qty{34}{\\micro m}$; \\qty{5.6e5}{W/m^2}.", "", "\\textbf{18.} $w_0' = \\qty{11}{\\micro m}$；\\qty{5e6}{W/m^2}；视网膜能承受", "\\qty{1}{mW} 持续回避反射所需的 \\qty{0.25}{s} --- 二类：可见，", "$\\le \\qty{1}{mW}$，因为人会眨眼，所以是安全的。", "", "\\textbf{19.} \\qty{6.7e-5}{rad}; $w_0 = \\qty{3}{mm}$, $z_{\\text{R}} = \\qty{45}{m}$,", "$w(\\qty{1}{km}) = \\qty{67}{mm}$: \\qty{13}{cm}.", "", "\\textbf{20.} $c/\\Delta\\nu$: \\qty{300}{m}; \\qty{30}{cm}.", "", "\\textbf{21.} $2.7 \\times 10^{17}$; \\qty{1}{GW}.", "", "\\textbf{22.} \\qty{1.8}{km}；仅衍射时为 \\qty{130}{m}。", "", "\\textbf{23.} $0.1/\\pi(1800)^2 = 10^{-8}$；$2.6 \\times 10^9$ 个光子。", "", "\\textbf{24.} $\\lambda/d = \\qty{1.3e-5}{rad}$, \\qty{5}{km}; $(0.5/5000)^2 = 10^{-8}$:", "$25$ 个光子，两个或三个被探测到。", "", "\\textbf{25.} \\qty{1.5}{cm}；\\qty{0.15}{mm}；退行在", "数周内测得。", "\\end{solution}", ""]}